# Default-fat sweep manifest (portable-syscall-layer C6).
# Every examples/**/*.kr is listed: `fat` (must build with plain krc) or
# `skip <lkm|obj-extern|bare-metal|riscv|xtensa|library>` (must NOT build as a
# hosted default fat binary). A file missing here, or listed but absent, reddens
# the examples_manifest_sweep row in tests/run_tests.sh.
